      "writtenOn": "2025-01-16T23:29:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand the purpose of adding the new modes. If you want the servo to be a sink (or a source), configure it to be a sink (or a source). A DRP should toggle, resulting in a sink 50% of the time and a source 50%.\n\nNote that the ChromeOS side always enables TrySrc. So even the servo is a DRP, the ChromeOS results in a source 100%.",
      "revId": "eb17e346afa8f6d39735b3fbb00909e9dd280fae",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
